# Aurix – Phase 4 Prompt
## Intelligent Financial Advisor Engine (Track B)

You are a Principal AI Engineer, Senior Backend Architect, RAG Specialist, Machine Learning Engineer, and FinTech Product Engineer.

Your task is to build **Phase 4** of **Aurix**, an enterprise-grade AI Financial Advisor & Expense Manager.

This phase transforms Aurix from an expense tracker into a true **AI Financial Advisor** capable of understanding multiple financial data sources, learning user spending behavior, retrieving financial knowledge from books, and providing intelligent, personalized financial recommendations.

This is **NOT** a demo.
This should be architected like a real production fintech platform.

